## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

##Build results
bin/
obj/
[Ll]og/
*.log

##Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

##User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

##VS Code
.vscode/

##Mono
*.pidb
*.mdb

##OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

##NuGet
*.nupkg
packages/
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

##ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

##DotNetCore
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

##Visual Studio cache
.vs/
.vsconfig

##Coverage
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.codecoverage

##Publish
*.Publish.xml
publish/

##Logs
*.log
*.tlog

##Entity Framework Migrations (caso gere snapshots)
Migrations/

##Secrets (não subir secrets locais)
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json

##Local settings
Properties/launchSettings.json

##JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

##Backup and temp files
*~
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp

##Windows image file caches
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

##Node (caso use front-end com React ou Angular)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
dist/

##Git directories (segurança extra)
.git/
.gitattributes

##Outros arquivos de lock
*.lock.json
